  "body": "Once [MSC2946](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2946) lands we should (at some point) switch to a stable endpoint and make some updates. There's few bits to this that we need to do:\r\n\r\n## Phase 1\r\n\r\n* [x] Support to the stable endpoint.\r\n* [x] ~~Require `limit` to be > 0.~~ (This has always been correct.)\r\n* [x] Ensure the endpoint is ratelimited.\r\n\r\n## Phase 2\r\n\r\n* [x] Remove the fallback logic of `get_room_hierarchy` to request the `/spaces` endpoint over federation.\r\n* [x] Remove the `/spaces` client and federation endpoints (and corresponding code in the handlers).\r\n* [x] Update the API responses to remove `allowed_spaces` (this was replaced with `allowed_room_ids`).\r\n* [x] Clean-up code around max-children, which is not used by the `/hierarchy` endpoint.\r\n* [x] Remove `room_id` from the serialized `children_state`, it is redundant and removed from the API response.\r\n\r\n## Phase 3\r\n\r\n* [x] Remove unstable `/hierarchy` client and federation endpoints.\r\n* [x] Remove the typo `join_rules` field from the response.",
